          "sourceDoi": "10.1073/pnas.2308668121",
          "targetDoi": "10.1039/c8sm01817k",
          "snippet": "The adopted approximation balances efficiency and accuracy, making it possible to deal with infinite-dimensional, homogeneous CVs. To our knowledge, multidimensional GLEs have only been used so far to study the few-body dynamics of low-dimensional CVs (  52   –  54  ).",
          "type": "mentioning"
